OL,5,BD64 image configuration                
OL,6, The D64 image also includes aFCONFIG   
OL,7, program. You can use it to change user 
OL,8, settings, such as your preferred       
OL,9, teletext service and the startup page. 
OL,10, You can also adjust the auto-refresh   
OL,11, interval and the delay before subpages 
OL,12, are automatically rotated. If you want 
OL,13, to run a local PetsciiProxy server, you
OL,14, can configure the IP address and port. 
OL,16,BStand alone configuration              
OL,17, TheFWiC64GandFMeatloafGstand alone     
OL,18, editions have their own built inFCONFIG
OL,19, screen where user preferences can be   
OL,20, set.They get stored on the Petscii-    
OL,21, Proxy server and loaded the next time  
OL,22, the program starts.                    
